# Applies to `tests/docker/systemd/Dockerfile`, which builds from the repo root. The other two
# Dockerfiles build from their own directories, so Docker never consults this file for them.
#
# Deny everything, then re-include, so a file added at the root later stays out of the image until
# somebody names it. `**` rather than `*`, since `*` does not match across `/`.
**

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

!audera
!audera/**
!brand
!brand/**
!tests
!tests/**
!os/dietpi/lib/common.sh
!os/dietpi/lib/streamer.sh

# Re-excluded after the re-inclusions, since a later pattern wins. Byte caches are built against
# the host's interpreter.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
